                  "theoryContent": "### Historical Phases of Telangana Statehood\n\n#### 1. Police Action & Hyderabad State (1948)\n* 'Operation Polo' initiated on 13 September 1948; completed on 17 September 1948.\n* Military Governor Major General J.N. Chaudhuri took administration.\n\n#### 2. The Gentlemen Agreement (20 February 1956)\n* Signed at Hyderabad House, New Delhi between Andhra and Telangana leaders.\n* Provided for Telangana Regional Committee, expenditure ratio (2:1), and cabinet safeguards.",
